This privacy policy applies to the SumLogic app for mobile devices, created by Nayem Dewan ("Service Provider") as a free service.
INFORMATION COLLECTION AND USE
The Application stores the salary, attendance, and profile information you enter locally on your device so the app can work offline. The Application does not require cloud storage for normal use.
The Application does not gather precise information about the location of your mobile device. The Application does not use Artificial Intelligence (AI) technologies to process your data.
THIRD PARTY ACCESS
By default, your data stays on your phone. Optional cloud sync features, if configured by the user, may use third-party services separately.
DATA RETENTION POLICY
Your data remains stored locally on this device until you uninstall the Application or remove it manually. To request support, contact nayem@mail.com.
CHILDREN
The Application does not address anyone under the age of 13.
SECURITY
The Service Provider provides reasonable safeguards for the information stored and processed by the Application on your device.
